# Agent Behavior
- Scan the codebase for patterns regarding Data fetching and updating and use this
- Scan the mobile/api directory for the data types and api calls
- Scan the available components and never use gluestack ui components or mantine components
- Use our own library @eduinteractive/balladui located in mobile/node_modules/@eduinteractive/balladui for UI Components
- Scan the other pages for how @eduinteractive/balladui is used and use this pattern in UI implementations
- You can use the core/svh-web microservice as a reference which data is in which way displayed but never use the same components because these are web components